# Compose / Unraid

`DATA_FOLDER_GAMES` mounts `/storage:ro` (scan root only). `LIBRARY_HOST_PATH` mounts the library RW (covers, themes, uploads). Do not put uploads on the games share.

App port in Compose is 5006. This Windows host uses `GT_PORT=6120` (Windows reserves 5041–5140). Test database container is `gametheca-review-db`, not `gametheca-postgres`.

Sidecars are profiles: `livekit`, `clamav`, `challenge`. Observability is optional and never required. Default `UVICORN_WORKERS=1`. Never require Grafana for the product to be ops-ready.

Do not overwrite the live root `.env`; templates are `.env.example`, `.env.docker.example`, `.env.unraid.example`, `.env.nas.example`.
